{"seq":1,"slug":"payout-reconciliation-ledger-match","title":"打款对账：通道流水、回执与账实相符","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-payout-global-disbursement-remittance-ops/reconciliation-exception-ops/payout-reconciliation-ledger-match","wordCount":2660,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"打款对账-通道流水-回执与账实相符\">打款对账：通道流水、回执与账实相符</h1><p>批量打款系统在提交批次那一刻，内部账本上写下的只有「应付减少、在途增加」两条分录。但这两条分录是否真的对应了银行账户里发生的事，系统自己并不知道——它只知道自己<em>发出</em>了一条指令。跨境电商平台每天向上万个卖家、横跨 ACH/SEPA/Pix/SWIFT 四种清算网络打出上万笔款，其中必然有被退回的、被改账号的、被中转行扣费的、金额被 FX 换算后差几分的。<strong>把「我以为我打了」变成「我确认我打了、且金额分毫不差」，就是这一章要建的东西：三方对账。</strong> 报文怎么写、端到端标识怎么挂，见同章的 <a href=\"../batch-routing-execution/batch-file-payment-message-format\">批量打款文件生成与通道报文格式</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三方对账与账实相符\">核心概念：三方对账与账实相符</h2><p>对账（reconciliation）不是「把两份文件比一比」。它要回答一个更严格的问题：<strong>平台账本上记录的每一分钱负债，是否都能在外部世界找到对应的资金事实，且两侧的金额、币种、时点、状态完全一致。</strong> 单靠内部数据永远无法自证，因为内部数据是同一套 bug 的产物；必须引入平台控制不了的外部凭证作为 ground truth。</p>\n<p>一笔打款的生命周期里有三份独立的事实来源，缺一不可：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>内部账本（ledger）</strong>：平台自己的分录，键是 <code>payable_id</code> + 批次号，金额是平台<em>认为</em>该付的数。</li>\n<li><strong>通道流水（channel statement / settlement report）</strong>：通道侧的对账单或结算明细。Stripe 用 Balance Transactions + Payouts、Adyen 用 Settlement details report、PayPal 用 Settlement Report、跨境通道多用 ISO 20022 的 <code>camt.053</code>（日终对账单）与 <code>camt.054</code>（借贷通知）。它给的键是通道自己的 <code>payout_id</code>，金额是通道<em>实际执行</em>的数。</li>\n<li><strong>银行回单（bank statement / credit advice）</strong>：收款行入账或退回的凭证，SWIFT 链路上表现为 <code>MT103</code> 贷记证实、<code>camt.053/054</code> 入账分录，或退汇报文 <code>pacs.004</code> / <code>MT103 RETN</code>。它给的键是 <code>UETR</code> 或 <code>AcctSvcrRef</code>，金额是<em>真正到卖家手里</em>的数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者的结构关系决定了整个对账链路：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[内部账本&lt;br/&gt;payable_id + batch_id] --&gt; D{逐笔匹配}&#10;    B[通道流水 camt.053 / settlement report&lt;br/&gt;payout_id] --&gt; D&#10;    C[银行回单 camt.053 / MT103 / pacs.004&lt;br/&gt;UETR] --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt;|三方键对齐且金额一致| E[状态 MATCHED 结清负债]&#10;    D --&gt;|金额差| F[差异 部分到账/手续费扣减]&#10;    D --&gt;|状态差| G[差异 退回/未到账/重复]&#10;    D --&gt;|找不到对手方| H[差异 单边挂账]&#10;    E --&gt; I[账实相符 reconciliation balance = 0]&#10;    F --&gt; J[差异队列 分类处置]&#10;    G --&gt; J&#10;    H --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n    A[内部账本&lt;br/&gt;payable_id + batch_id] --&gt; D{逐笔匹配}\n    B[通道流水 camt.053 / settlement report&lt;br/&gt;payout_id] --&gt; D\n    C[银行回单 camt.053 / MT103 / pacs.004&lt;br/&gt;UETR] --&gt; D\n    D --&gt;|三方键对齐且金额一致| E[状态 MATCHED 结清负债]\n    D --&gt;|金额差| F[差异 部分到账/手续费扣减]\n    D --&gt;|状态差| G[差异 退回/未到账/重复]\n    D --&gt;|找不到对手方| H[差异 单边挂账]\n    E --&gt; I[账实相符 reconciliation balance = 0]\n    F --&gt; J[差异队列 分类处置]\n    G --&gt; J\n    H --&gt; J</pre><p>「账实相符」在工程上是一个可计算的量：<strong>对账平衡差</strong>。定义某一时点、某一币种下的未解释差异为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>账本</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>外部</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>已解释调整</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{c} = \\sum_{i \\in \\text{账本}} a_i - \\sum_{j \\in \\text{外部}} a_j - \\sum_{k \\in \\text{已解释调整}} a_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">账本</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4804em;vertical-align:-1.4304em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">外部</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4304em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">已解释调整</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>健康系统的目标不是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 永远为 0——打款天然存在在途时差与未解释挂账——而是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>可解释比例</strong>接近 100%，且任何一笔无法解释的差异都有明确的处理人、处理时限与老化（aging）状态。单期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不等于零，但如果它连续多期同向累积而不收敛，说明匹配规则漏了某一类交易，而不是「时间差」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三类差异的成因与判据\">三类差异的成因与判据</h2><p>差异（exception / break）不能笼统处理，必须按成因分类，因为每一类的补救动作完全不同。工程上通常按「金额差 / 状态差 / 单边」三分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异类型</th>\n<th>典型成因</th>\n<th>判定判据</th>\n<th>处置动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>金额差（short/over）</td>\n<td>中转行扣费、FX 点差、通道手续费后扣</td>\n<td>键匹配但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext>账本</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext>外部</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>容差</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lvert a_{账本} - a_{外部} \\rvert &gt; \\text{容差}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">账本</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">外部</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">容差</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>生成手续费调整分录；点差入成本；超容差转人工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态差（returned/cancelled）</td>\n<td>退回、退汇、通道取消</td>\n<td>外部无入账且通道报文为退回态</td>\n<td>回滚在途、恢复应付、按失败码决定是否重发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复（duplicate）</td>\n<td>通道重复受理、幂等键失效</td>\n<td>同一键出现两条外部入账</td>\n<td>发起退汇/召回，冻结该卖家后续批次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单边账本侧</td>\n<td>账本记了但通道无流水</td>\n<td>超通道 T+N 窗口仍无对手方</td>\n<td>排查报文是否真的投出，必要时重驱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单边通道侧</td>\n<td>通道有流水但账本无应付</td>\n<td>出现未知 <code>payout_id</code></td>\n<td>排查是否有未入账批次或被遗漏的 payable</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>退回语义在四大网络里各有专名，混用会导致分类错位。美国 ACH 用 <strong>Nacha Return Codes</strong>：<code>R01</code> 余额不足、<code>R02</code> 账户已销户、<code>R03</code> 无法定位账户、<code>R04</code> 账号无效；通知变更用 <strong>NOC（Notification of Change）</strong>，如 <code>C01</code> 账号错误、<code>C02</code> 路由号错误、<code>C03</code> 路由与账号均错误——NOC 不退回资金，但要求平台更新收款人凭证后重发。SEPA 区用 <strong>EPC 规则书定义的 R-transactions</strong>：Reject（结算前拒绝）、Return（结算后退回）、Recall（请求召回）、Refund（收款方退回首笔）、Reversal（同币种反向冲正）。SWIFT 代理行链路上，退汇以 <code>pacs.004</code> 或 <code>MT103</code> 加退汇头返回，并通过 <strong>UETR</strong> 与原始 <code>pacs.008</code> 关联。把这些码映射进内部统一枚举是「通道适配层」的职责，不能让上游对账逻辑去分辨四套命名（来源：Nacha Operating Rules 附录 Return/NOC Code 表；European Payments Council SEPA Credit Transfer Rulebook 的 R-transaction 章节；ISO 20022 <code>pacs.004</code> 定义）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"匹配引擎-键-窗口与容差\">匹配引擎：键、窗口与容差</h2><p>匹配（matching）的质量取决于三个参数，任一失配都会把正常交易误判成差异。</p>\n<p><strong>匹配键</strong>必须多级回退（cascade），因为不同通道回传的标识粒度不同。稳妥的优先级是：<code>UETR</code> / <code>EndToEndId</code>（端到端唯一，跨代理行仍稳定）→ 通道 <code>payout_id</code> → <code>(收款账号, 金额, 币种, 值日)</code> 组合键。前两级精确匹配，第三级兜底模糊匹配，用于通道不回传平台标识的场合（部分本地清算网络即如此）。组合键必须带<strong>容差</strong>，否则中转行扣费或 FX 取整会把每一笔都判成金额差。</p>\n<p>容差不是常量，要按币种与金额分档：小额高频 corridor（如菲律宾 InstaPay、印度 UPI）用绝对值容差，大额 SWIFT 汇款用比例容差，因为后者的中转行费用与点差随金额浮动：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>match</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>小额本地通道</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>大额代理行</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{match}(a_b, a_e) = \\begin{cases} \\lvert a_b - a_e \\rvert \\le \\tau_{abs} &amp; \\text{小额本地通道} \\\\[4pt] \\dfrac{\\lvert a_b - a_e \\rvert}{\\max(a_b, a_e)} \\le \\tau_{rel} &amp; \\text{大额代理行} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">match</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.203em;vertical-align:-1.8515em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.3515em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.7705em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.427em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5115em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.427em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8515em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.3515em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.7705em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.427em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">小额本地通道</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5115em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.427em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">大额代理行</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8515em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>匹配窗口</strong>决定何时把差异判为「超期」。打款有真实的清算时差：本地实时网络（Pix、UPI、Nexus 互联下的多数跨境）秒级到账，SEPA 当日（T+0）或次日，ACH 为 T+1 到 T+2，SWIFT 代理行常为 T+1 到 T+3 并受中转行节假日影响。窗口太短，正常在途交易被误报成单边差异，噪音淹没真正的异常；窗口太长，退回资金长期占着在途科目，账实相符率虚高。应按通道 SLA 设定各自窗口，临近边界加权预警而非一刀切。</p>\n<p>合并与拆分是最易被低估的难点。平台逐笔打款，通道却可能把同批多笔<strong>合并成一条银行入账</strong>（net settlement），或把一笔拆成多笔（部分到账 + 部分退回）。此时逐笔精确匹配全线失败，必须支持<strong>分组匹配（many-to-many）</strong>：组内先校验合计金额与笔数，再做逐笔分配。其正确性依赖控制合计字段——ISO 20022 <code>pacs.008</code> 的 <code>CtrlSum</code>/<code>NbOfTxs</code>、Nacha 批次的 Batch Control Record 都提供组级校验和。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异常运营-挂账-老化与重驱\">异常运营：挂账、老化与重驱</h2><p>差异一旦产生就进入<strong>异常队列（exception queue）</strong>，其运营质量由三个机制决定，而不是由「有没有差异」决定。</p>\n<p><strong>挂账与对账科目</strong>。未解释差异不能直接冲销，必须落在专门的<strong>对账挂账科目（suspense account）<strong>上，与卖家应付分离。挂账余额就是「平台暂时说不清归属的钱」，是运营健康度的直接指标：长期不降说明差异只被记录、从未被处置。挂账要有</strong>老化分层</strong>（0–7 天、8–30 天、30 天以上），每层有独立 SLA 与责任归属，超期未清升级为财务事项而非技术工单。</p>\n<p><strong>重驱与幂等</strong>。对「账本记了、通道无流水」的单边差异，处置动作往往是重新投递报文（re-drive）。这里必须复用与首次提交完全相同的<strong>幂等键</strong>，否则通道把重驱当成新指令，会制造真正的重复付款。幂等键的构成、长度上限（Stripe 255 字符、Adyen <code>Idempotency-Key</code> 64 字符）与 24 小时清理窗口，见 <a href=\"../batch-routing-execution/batch-file-payment-message-format\">批量打款文件生成与通道报文格式</a> 与 <a href=\"../batch-routing-execution/smart-routing-failover-strategy\">智能路由、通道选择与降级策略</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>退回与 NOC 的闭环</strong>。退回不是终点而是分支：<code>R01</code> 类可修复的退回应触发自动重发，<code>R02</code>/<code>R03</code> 类不可修复的退回应回滚负债；NOC 应回写收款人凭证库、修正后重发，同时把「凭证错误率」作为通道与卖家画像的质量指标。闭环判据是<strong>首次入账成功率（first-pass yield）<strong>与</strong>平均清结时长（mean time to clear）</strong>，它们比差异总数更能反映真实健康度。Visa Direct 等卡推送通道覆盖 150+ 币种、195+ 国家和地区、可及 18B+ 端点，覆盖越广，退回码的种类与本地语义差异越大，闭环越不能依赖单一通道的码表（来源：Visa Direct 产品页；FSB《Targets for addressing the four challenges of cross-border payments》对到账速度与成本设定的 2027 目标）。</p>\n<p>对账的自动化上限决定运营成本。健康系统应把 95% 以上的交易做成自动匹配与自动结清，人工只留给真正模糊的差异；衡量指标是<strong>自动匹配率（auto-match rate）</strong>、<strong>未解释挂账余额</strong>与<strong>挂账龄分布</strong>三者，而非「今天有几条差异」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[差异生成] --&gt; B{可自动归类}&#10;    B --&gt;|匹配到已知模式| C[自动处置&lt;br/&gt;调整分录/自动重驱/回滚]&#10;    B --&gt;|无法归类| D[进入异常队列]&#10;    D --&gt; E[按成因与老化分层]&#10;    E --&gt; F{超 SLA}&#10;    F --&gt;|否| G[责任人跟进]&#10;    F --&gt;|是| H[升级财务/合规]&#10;    C --&gt; I[回落挂账余额]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[对账平衡差收敛]\">flowchart TD\n    A[差异生成] --&gt; B{可自动归类}\n    B --&gt;|匹配到已知模式| C[自动处置&lt;br/&gt;调整分录/自动重驱/回滚]\n    B --&gt;|无法归类| D[进入异常队列]\n    D --&gt; E[按成因与老化分层]\n    E --&gt; F{超 SLA}\n    F --&gt;|否| G[责任人跟进]\n    F --&gt;|是| H[升级财务/合规]\n    C --&gt; I[回落挂账余额]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[对账平衡差收敛]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>对账的基础是<strong>三方</strong>：内部账本、通道流水、银行回单。只用内部数据无法自证，必须引入平台控制不了的外部凭证。</li>\n<li>「账实相符」是可计算量：对账平衡差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的可解释比例接近 100%，且未解释差异有责任人与时限，比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 恒为零更现实。</li>\n<li>差异按金额差 / 状态差 / 重复 / 单边分类，每类处置动作不同。退回语义要统一映射 Nacha Return/NOC、SEPA R-transaction、SWIFT <code>pacs.004</code> 三套码表，不能让上游对账逻辑去分辨。</li>\n<li>匹配靠多级键回退 + 币种分档容差 + 按通道 SLA 设定的窗口；合并/拆分场景必须支持分组匹配，依赖 <code>CtrlSum</code>/<code>NbOfTxs</code> 做组级校验。</li>\n<li>未解释差异落<strong>对账挂账科目</strong>并老化分层，重驱必须复用幂等键，NOC 回写凭证后重发，形成退回闭环。</li>\n<li>核心指标是自动匹配率、未解释挂账余额与挂账龄分布；运营目标是 95%+ 自动结清。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸：差异处置后的负债回滚与余额桶释放见 <a href=\"../payable-settlement-model/payable-balance-ledger\">卖家应付账款与可打款余额建模</a>；退回后的通道降级与成本重估见 <a href=\"../global-disbursement-rail/rail-types-clearing-networks\">全球付款通道类型与清算网络对比</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"打款对账：通道流水、回执与账实相符","id":"打款对账-通道流水-回执与账实相符"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三方对账与账实相符","id":"核心概念-三方对账与账实相符"},{"level":2,"text":"三类差异的成因与判据","id":"三类差异的成因与判据"},{"level":2,"text":"匹配引擎：键、窗口与容差","id":"匹配引擎-键-窗口与容差"},{"level":2,"text":"异常运营：挂账、老化与重驱","id":"异常运营-挂账-老化与重驱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"打款状态机、幂等控制与部分失败处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-payout-global-disbursement-remittance-ops/batch-routing-execution/payment-state-machine-idempotency"},"next":{"title":"退汇、挂账、退回与人工补发处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-payout-global-disbursement-remittance-ops/reconciliation-exception-ops/return-hold-manual-reissue"}}